    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμισθ-ί</span></b> , Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμισθος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without reward</i> or <i>hire,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				41
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				409
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.99
			</span></i>; <i>rent-free</i>, <i><span class="en">
